  "keyFeatures": [
    "QR-code-driven digital menu for hotel guests",
    "Menu Manager with categories, availability toggles, and dietary info",
    "Staff Management with role-based access control",
    "Page Manager to enable/disable guest and staff pages without coding",
    "System Configuration: brand identity, payments, Wi-Fi, public profile",
    "Loyalty Programs: stamp cards, visit count, buy-X-get-Y rewards",
    "Dynamic Pricing: time-based and day-based price adjustment rules",
    "Analytics dashboard with revenue charts, best sellers, and export",
    "Fraud Control / Audit Log for staff activity monitoring",
    "Telegram bot integration for live order notifications",
    "Real-time Operations views: Staff Dashboard and Kitchen Queue"
